; STARTING RANGE (Eric, 2026-11-04: "chain lightning range starts too big"): 450 reached past the top and bottom
; of a PC screen. 320 starts inside it, and the reach grows +40 at levels 3 and 6, to 400. The same range is
; the reach of Threefold Curses extra bolts (ChainLightning.ThrowVolley); the hops have their own.
